From: Claude <claude@example.com>
Date: Thu, 15 Oct 2026 07:58:35 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Patch 2: MediaStore data layer with paging

- Domain: MediaItem model, MediaRepository, GetPagedMediaUseCase
- Data: MediaStoreDataSource (offset/limit queries on the Files collection, newest first),
  MediaPagingSource with placeholders + jump support, ContentObserver auto-refresh
- DI: RepositoryModule binding the repository
- Presentation: PicturesViewModel and a minimal Coil-backed grid to verify the pipeline
- Add Paging 3 Compose, Coil 3 (+ video frames)
